Subject: [PATCH 02/10] fix(imports): standalone audit fixes for /imports and
 prior imports (GFE-IMPORTS)

From the Design System Agent's standalone audit:
- Game-imports header wraps at 320px with 200% text (min-w-0, breaks).
- One accent-filled action per phase: Clear all, Remove and Prior
  imports move to secondary.
- Import dialog scrolls within the viewport.
- Each sending row has a progress bar (role=progressbar); a 0-byte file
  no longer shows NaN%.
- The game select uses selectClasses (field colour, focus ring, 44px).
- Long game titles wrap in the running header.
- Empty states use compact (h2, tighter padding); corrected-file and
  Add the game links are 44px.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0158uxufnvDxf4SMdnVi7Gjt
