From 0c43e1b5915c493c046202629858cb71f7a3a671 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 08:25:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 03/10] fix(catalog-admin): standalone audit fixes for add/edit
 game and add build (GFE-CATALOG-ADMIN)

From the Design System Agent's standalone audit:
- Studio and Game selects use selectClasses: 44px, padded, native arrow.
- Form cards use the Card primitive, p-4 on phones so the column stays
  usable at 320px with 200% text.
- Footers wrap; the submit is full width on phones.
- Cancel and inline links are 44px.
- Off-scale values moved to the scale (gap-2, px-3, mt-1), weights to
  700/500, duration to --dur, the step tick to --color-accent-ink.
- The visibility panel uses surface-2 instead of a mint tint.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0158uxufnvDxf4SMdnVi7Gjt
