From 78092614e95753cf179c2cbb69c9a72344209ab4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 08:36:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 08/10] fix(review): standalone audit fixes for the session
 detail page (GFE-REVIEW)

From the Design System Agent's standalone audit:
- The seek bar has a 44px grab area, and Play, Mute and Full screen are
  44px, without making the overlay taller; each has a focus ring and a
  hover state.
- Transport controls use inline SVG icons instead of Unicode glyphs.
- The player shows a spinner while the recording loads.
- The overlay uses fixed primitives (--color-ink-base, --color-surface-
  white), so it stays legible over video in both themes; the dim total
  time is darker-backed for AA.
- Moment markers use chart colours, not the negative/mixed status
